\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec6 Early Validation & Traction:
\f2\b0 \'a0I'm transitioning from a foundation of full-time Lead SRE/DevOps, and some B2B cloud and infrastructure consulting, into building this scalable AI product ecosystem. The architecture is blueprinted, the core domains are secured, and we are currently using lightweight consumer media tools to drive user acquisition for the broader autonomous ecosystem.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0
